libwebsockets
------------------------------------------
libwebsockets is a lightweight GPL2 http and websocket server that hides all
the protocol handshakes and detail from the user code driving the server.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libavcodec63-9.0.2-2
  libavformat63-9.0.2-2
  libavutil61-9.0.2-2
  libbrotlidec1-1.2.1-1
  libbrotlienc1-1.2.1-1
  libdbus1_3-1.16.2-1
  libevent2.1_7-2.1.13-1
  libglib2.0_0-2.90.1-1
  libssl3-3.5.9-1
  libswresample7-9.0.2-2
  libswscale10-9.0.2-2
  libuv1-1.53.0-1
  libwebsockets-devel-5.0.0-1bl1
  libwebsockets22-5.0.0-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1
  zlib0-1.3.2-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.4-1
  cygport-0.37.11-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libavcodec-devel-9.0.2-2
  libavformat-devel-9.0.2-2
  libavutil-devel-9.0.2-2
  libbrotli-devel-1.2.1-1
  libdbus1-devel-1.16.2-1
  libevent-devel-2.1.13-1
  libglib2.0-devel-2.90.1-1
  libsqlite3-devel-3.49.1-1
  libssl-devel-3.5.9-1
  libswresample-devel-9.0.2-2
  libswscale-devel-9.0.2-2
  libuv-devel-1.53.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  zlib-devel-1.3.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/warmcat/libwebsockets

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/warmcat/libwebsockets/archive/refs/tags/v5.0.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libwebsockets-5.0.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libwebsockets-5.0.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libwebsockets-5.0.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libwebsockets-5.0.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libwebsockets22-5.0.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libwebsockets-devel-5.0.0-X.tar.xz

